This repository contains the software developed for the undergraduate
dissertation "Development of a System for Detecting Unauthorized Use of Facial
Images and Indicating Synthetic Alteration in Online Content" (Democritus
University of Thrace, Department of Informatics, Kavala, 2026).

Permission to use, copy, modify, and distribute this software for academic,
